# Seller uploads product
#         ↓
# Customer selects and pays
#         ↓
# Seller prepares the order
#         ↓
# Seller marks it ready for pickup
#         ↓
# Xerin sends the delivery request to the dependent delivery system
#         ↓
# The delivery system handles courier, pickup and delivery
#         ↓
# Signed webhooks update Xerin automatically